# Check every text file out with LF on all three platforms.
#
# `text=auto` alone normalises to LF *in the repository* but converts to CRLF
# on a Windows checkout. That broke the frontend tests, which lift functions
# out of app.js by searching for "\n}\n" -- a CRLF checkout makes that
# substring absent, and 27 tests errored at fixture setup on windows-latest.
# The app is served to browsers and parsed by node; LF is the correct form
# everywhere, so pin it rather than leaving it to the platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
